lie Luchetta]]"],"published":"2026-04-07","created":"2026-07-07","description":"On last March's Trans Visibility Day, Gov. Brad Little signed into law a bill that criminalizes trans people for using public restrooms not aligned with their birth sex. For some, that means living in Idaho is simply not tenable anymore."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},